01:01:15,000 --> 01:01:21,000
Air Bud is a 1997 sports comedy-drama film directed by Charles Martin Smith.

11
01:07:22,500 --> 01:07:28,500
An international co-production of the United States and Canada, the film stars Kevin Zegers as a young boy who
befriends a runaway Golden Retriever (portrayed by Buddy) with a unique ability to play basketball.

12
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
Air Bud received mixed reviews but was a commercial success, grossing $4 million in its opening
weekend and totaling $27.8 million in its run against an estimated $3 million budget.

13
01:19:37,500 --> 01:19:43,500
It was followed by a direct sequel, Air Bud: Golden Receiver, in 1998, and spawned
a film franchise that includes the spin-off series Air Buddies.

14
01:25:45,000 --> 01:25:51,000
The film explores themes of sports, clown, basketball, dog, golden retriever.

